<title>USA: Greater Beijing 1st Expressways sells $288mln debt.</title>
<headline>Greater Beijing 1st Expressways sells $288mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from Greater Beijing 1st Expressways was priced on Thursday via a Morgan Stanley Dean Witter group, market sources said.</p>
<p>The 10-year tranche was increased in size by $13 million, one source said.</p>
<p>BORROWER GREATER BEIJING 1ST EXPRESSWAYS</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR UNSCD NTS ISS PRICE 99.796   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba1   YIELD 9.29 PCT     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P BB		 SPREAD 287.5 BP    CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: One year interest reserve</p>
<p>AMT $188 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR UNSCD NTS ISS PRICE 99.365   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba1   YIELD 9.60 PCT     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P BB		 SPREAD 312.5 BP    CALLABLE NON CALL SEVEN</p>
<p>NOTE: One year interest reserve ((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
